{"id":"4d04b869450b424f","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-complexity.md","title":"GL Complexity","display":"df-gl-complexity — GL Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-complexity","aliases":["89-df-gl-complexity"],"display":"df-gl-complexity — GL Complexity","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-function]]","[[89-df-effective-computation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-complexity — GL Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3bbdf6f3419b5805\" href=\"?note=3bbdf6f3419b5805\" title=\"89-df-gl-algorithm\">89-df-gl-algorithm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3997bfb78544d69c\" href=\"?note=3997bfb78544d69c\" title=\"89-df-effective-computation\">89-df-effective-computation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为非空有限字母表；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是固定的有效单射。</li>\n<li>保留原来选定的确定机器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span>。其配置数据为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,I,\\delta,H,o)\">\\((C,I,\\delta,H,o)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是配置集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I:\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\to C\">\\(I:\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\to C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta:C\\to C\">\\(\\delta:C\\to C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq C\">\\(H\\subseteq C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o:H\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(o:H\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 是该机器的一步转移，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall c\\in H\\ (\\delta(c)=c)\">\\(\\forall c\\in H\\ (\\delta(c)=c)\\)</span>。初始配置计为第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 步，不另加输入输出开销。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\exists k\\in\\omega\\ [\\delta^k(I(\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}(A)))\\in H\\land o(\\delta^k(I(\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}(A))))=d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)]\">\\(\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\exists k\\in\\omega\\ [\\delta^k(I(\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}(A)))\\in H\\land o(\\delta^k(I(\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}(A))))=d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)]\\)</span>。本条不要求机器在非公式编码上停机。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{steps}\">\\(\\mathrm{steps}\\)</span> 的域为该固定机器的停机输入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Time}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Time}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 仍针对上述同一实现与编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta^0(c)&amp;\\coloneqq c,\\quad\\delta^{k+1}(c)\\coloneqq\\delta(\\delta^k(c)),\\\\\nD_{\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid\\exists k\\in\\omega\\ \\delta^k(I(x))\\in H\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{steps}(\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}},x)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{k\\in\\omega\\mid\\delta^k(I(x))\\in H\\}\n\\quad(x\\in D_{\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}}}),\\\\\nE_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}(A)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\ |\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}(A)|\\le n\\},\\\\\n&amp;E_n\\subseteq D_{\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}}}\\cap\\bigcup_{j\\le n}\\Sigma^j,\\quad\n|E_n|\\le\\sum_{j\\le n}|\\Sigma|^j,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Time}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\max\\left(\\{\\mathrm{steps}(\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}},x)\\mid x\\in E_n\\}\\cup\\{0\\}\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Time}_{\\mathrm{GL}}&amp;:\\omega\\to\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta^0(c)&amp;\\coloneqq c,\\quad\\delta^{k+1}(c)\\coloneqq\\delta(\\delta^k(c)),\\\\\nD_{\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid\\exists k\\in\\omega\\ \\delta^k(I(x))\\in H\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{steps}(\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}},x)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{k\\in\\omega\\mid\\delta^k(I(x))\\in H\\}\n\\quad(x\\in D_{\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}}}),\\\\\nE_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}(A)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\ |\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}(A)|\\le n\\},\\\\\n&amp;E_n\\subseteq D_{\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}}}\\cap\\bigcup_{j\\le n}\\Sigma^j,\\quad\n|E_n|\\le\\sum_{j\\le n}|\\Sigma|^j,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Time}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\max\\left(\\{\\mathrm{steps}(\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}},x)\\mid x\\in E_n\\}\\cup\\{0\\}\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Time}_{\\mathrm{GL}}&amp;:\\omega\\to\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只把原有“选定实现的步数”展开为其确定转移系统的首次停机时刻。未固定新的机器型号，也未将该实现的时间函数改成与实现无关的复杂度断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-algorithm","status":"resolved","id":"3bbdf6f3419b5805","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-effective-computation","status":"resolved","id":"3997bfb78544d69c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-effective-computation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\Sigma^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"(C,I,\\delta,H,o)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"I:\\Sigma^{<\\omega}\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta:C\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"H\\subseteq C","display":false},{"tex":"o:H\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall c\\in H\\ (\\delta(c)=c)","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\exists k\\in\\omega\\ [\\delta^k(I(\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}(A)))\\in H\\land o(\\delta^k(I(\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}(A))))=d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)]","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{steps}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Time}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta^0(c)&\\coloneqq c,\\quad\\delta^{k+1}(c)\\coloneqq\\delta(\\delta^k(c)),\\\\\nD_{\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}}}&\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\Sigma^{<\\omega}\\mid\\exists k\\in\\omega\\ \\delta^k(I(x))\\in H\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{steps}(\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}},x)&\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{k\\in\\omega\\mid\\delta^k(I(x))\\in H\\}\n\\quad(x\\in D_{\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}}}),\\\\\nE_n&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}(A)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\ |\\mathrm{enc}_{\\Box}(A)|\\le n\\},\\\\\n&E_n\\subseteq D_{\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}}}\\cap\\bigcup_{j\\le n}\\Sigma^j,\\quad\n|E_n|\\le\\sum_{j\\le n}|\\Sigma|^j,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Time}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(n)&\\coloneqq\n\\max\\left(\\{\\mathrm{steps}(\\widehat d_{\\mathrm{GL}},x)\\mid x\\in E_n\\}\\cup\\{0\\}\\right),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Time}_{\\mathrm{GL}}&:\\omega\\to\\omega.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2239,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-282","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-complexity]]"}],"outgoing":["3bbdf6f3419b5805","56c1b5b75a32ca1d","0d71e87a2f416230","3997bfb78544d69c"]}